{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Drop: Save the Forest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Drop: Save the Forest</strong>, you step into the tiny yet determined droplets of <i>Drop</i>, a water hero sent by the Rain Clouds to protect a burning alpine forest.<br>Inspired by the stunning landscapes of the <strong>Dolomites</strong>, the game blends <strong>puzzle-solving</strong>, exploration, and environmental storytelling into a charming pixel art adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wildfire is ravaging the forest. Plants, animals, and entire biomes are in danger.<br>Armed with your water abilities, you\u2019ll navigate from the mountain\u2019s base to its snowy peaks, solving environmental puzzles, extinguishing fires, and restoring balance to nature.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-based Levels</strong> \u2013 Each stage challenges you to think creatively, combining elements like <strong>water, ice, wind, and fire</strong> to restore harmony.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Environment</strong> \u2013 Push rocks, unlock water sources, climb cliffs, and use the terrain to your advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Hazards</strong> \u2013 Beware! Wind can spread pollen\u2026 or fire. Fire can block your path\u2026 or become your main obstacle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wildlife Encounters</strong> \u2013 Meet friendly forest creatures to rescue and dangerous elemental \u201cfire\u201d enemies to outsmart.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932710/extras/c5f8d7a1a5ec646bcf191aeab852c58c.poster.avif?t=1760015981\" width=360 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932710/extras/c5f8d7a1a5ec646bcf191aeab852c58c.webm?t=1760015981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932710/extras/c5f8d7a1a5ec646bcf191aeab852c58c.mp4?t=1760015981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Nature-inspired settings</strong> based on alpine environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Challenging environmental puzzles</strong> with multiple solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca7 <strong>Unique elemental mechanics</strong> that interact in surprising ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Charming pixel art</strong> and hand-crafted animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you master the elements and save the forest?</strong><br>The forest needs its hero\u2026 will you be <i>the Drop</i> that makes the difference? \ud83d\udca6\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(try the mobile-friendly web version on itch, link on the external links section)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932710?t=1760015981","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932710?t=1760015981","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932710/0f92321b34f8f486a859c5ae37c33891cb48a801/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760015981","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932710/0f92321b34f8f486a859c5ae37c33891cb48a801/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760015981","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id